WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:07.082
The sounds were coming from the bandstand.

2
00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:10.439
Daisy saw a young man playing a saxophone.

3
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:17.082
"Oh! That's my clarinet teacher." Grace waved. "Hi, Riley!"

4
00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:20.100
"Oh, hey, Grace!" Riley waved back.

5
00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:25.374
"My band is about to play. I hope you'll stay and listen."

6
00:00:25.375 --> 00:00:29.707
"Sure!" Grace introduced Daisy and Kaleem.

7
00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:33.850
"Nice to meet you." Riley hopped down from the stage.

8
00:00:33.851 --> 00:00:37.645
"And who's this?" He rubbed Scamp's head.

9
00:00:37.646 --> 00:00:40.813
"My dog, Scamp," Grace said.

10
00:00:40.814 --> 00:00:44.891
"I wish my wife wasn't afraid of dogs," Riley said.

11
00:00:44.892 --> 00:00:49.082
"We live out in the country with lots of space for a dog to play."

12
00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:51.332
One of his bandmates heard him.

13
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.420
"I'm glad you live there.

14
00:00:53.421 --> 00:00:57.791
We can rehearse as loudly as we want without bothering anybody."

15
00:00:57.792 --> 00:01:04.193
Riley chuckled. "That's Spike. She plays guitar and sings some of our songs.

16
00:01:04.194 --> 00:01:07.957
I sing the rest." He kept petting Scamp.

17
00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:13.746
"I've never had a dog, but I had a parrot as a teenager. He was my muse."

18
00:01:13.747 --> 00:01:16.696
"What's a muse?" Daisy asked.

19
00:01:16.697 --> 00:01:21.231
"It's someone who inspires an artist." Riley grinned.

20
00:01:21.232 --> 00:01:24.470
"That bird inspired me to start writing songs.

21
00:01:24.471 --> 00:01:29.290
I still miss him. I had to find him a new home when I went to college.

22
00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:35.546
He was too noisy to live in a dorm."

23
00:01:35.547 --> 00:01:39.478
Soon Riley's band began to play.

24
00:01:39.479 --> 00:01:45.082
Kaleem bopped his head to the beat. "They're good!"

25
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:49.603
Riley grabbed the microphone and started singing.

26
00:01:49.604 --> 00:01:54.311
Just as he hit a high note, another sound drowned him out.

27
00:01:54.312 --> 00:01:56.774
Yooowl!

28
00:01:56.775 --> 00:01:59.624
"What's that?" Grace said.

29
